.IX Title "Lucy::Index::PostingListReader 3pm"
.TH Lucy::Index::PostingListReader 3pm 2026-09-16 "perl v5.40.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
Lucy::Index::PostingListReader \- Read postings data.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 6
\&    my $posting_list_reader 
\&        = $seg_reader\->obtain("Lucy::Index::PostingListReader");
\&    my $posting_list = $posting_list_reader\->posting_list(
\&        field => \*(Aqtitle\*(Aq, 
\&        term  => \*(Aqfoo\*(Aq,
\&    );
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
PostingListReaders produce PostingList
objects which convey document matching information.
.SH "ABSTRACT METHODS"
.IX Header "ABSTRACT METHODS"
.SS posting_list
.IX Subsection "posting_list"
.Vb 4
\&    my $posting_list = $posting_list_reader\->posting_list(
\&        field => $field,  # default: undef
\&        term  => $term,   # default: undef
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Returns a PostingList, or undef if either \f(CW\*(C`field\*(C'\fR is
undef or \f(CW\*(C`field\*(C'\fR is not present in any documents.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBfield\fR \- A field name.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBterm\fR \- If supplied, the PostingList will be pre-located to this
term using \fBseek()\fR.
.SH METHODS
.IX Header "METHODS"
.SS aggregator
.IX Subsection "aggregator"
.Vb 4
\&    my $result = $posting_list_reader\->aggregator(
\&        readers => $readers,  # required
\&        offsets => $offsets,  # required
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Returns undef since PostingLists may only be iterated at the
segment level.
.SH INHERITANCE
.IX Header "INHERITANCE"
Lucy::Index::PostingListReader isa Lucy::Index::DataReader isa Clownfish::Obj.
